<mxCell id="title" value="Telemetry Ingestion and Flight-Object Reception Pipelines | Aroma Pacifico" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=30;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#102a43;" parent="1" vertex="1">
  <mxGeometry x="40" y="25" width="3120" height="45" as="geometry" />
</mxCell>
<mxCell id="subtitle" value="Left-to-right processing flows: triggers, protocols, validation steps, storage targets, downstream event handling, failure handling, and rollback paths. AWS us-east-1. A14, A15, A17, A18." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=17;fontColor=#334e68;" parent="1" vertex="1">
  <mxGeometry x="40" y="75" width="3120" height="35" as="geometry" />
</mxCell>
<mxCell id="band1_container" value="TELEMETRY INGESTION PIPELINE | left-to-right flow: farm nodes to persistence, evaluation &amp;amp; crop alert (A14, A17, B09)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f8fc;strokeColor=#61788d;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#172b4d;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=15;" parent="1" vertex="1">
  <mxGeometry x="40" y="125" width="3120" height="540" as="geometry" />
</mxCell>
<mxCell id="b1_s1_card" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;4&quot; color=&quot;#102a43&quot;&gt;1. Field Sensor Nodes &amp;amp; Bearers&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0b69a3&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Triggers &amp;amp; Exit Protocols (A14, Connectivity sec 4)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Two Sensor Node Classes per Farm:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  - &lt;i&gt;Crop node:&lt;/i&gt; 6 readings/day (temp, humidity, pH, NPK)&lt;br/&gt;  - &lt;i&gt;Drying node:&lt;/i&gt; 24 readings/day while drying lot is open&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Secure Protocol &amp;amp; Device Identity (mTLS, D06):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  - MQTT over TLS 1.2+ on port 8883 (or 443 with ALPN)&lt;br/&gt;  - Unique per-node X.509 client certificate from CSR (ASM-010)&lt;br/&gt;  - Zero static shared keys; operational revocation in IoT Core&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Store-and-Forward Buffer (No-Signal Resilience):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  - Encrypted non-volatile ring buffer (&amp;gt;= 24 hours / 6 readings)&lt;br/&gt;  - On reconnect: live reading first, then drains oldest first&lt;br/&gt;  - &lt;code&gt;PUBACK&lt;/code&gt; acknowledgement releases reading from buffer&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Bearers:&lt;/b&gt; LTE multi-network SIM; satellite for no-coverage (ASM-073)&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Path:&lt;/b&gt; Direct to IoT Core; bypasses centers and VPC (CL-TEL-04)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#8da2b5;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#172b4d;fontSize=13.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;" parent="1" vertex="1">
  <mxGeometry x="70" y="175" width="490" height="465" as="geometry" />
</mxCell>
<mxCell id="b1_s2_card" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;4&quot; color=&quot;#102a43&quot;&gt;2. Regional Ingestion &amp;amp; Topic Rule&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0b69a3&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;AWS IoT Core &amp;amp; Pattern Module (ADR-003, B09)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;AWS IoT Core Regional Endpoint (us-east-1):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  - Public ATS endpoint; terminates mTLS with device certificates&lt;br/&gt;  - Validates client certificates against IoT Thing Registry&lt;br/&gt;  - Topic: &lt;code&gt;aroma/telemetry/&amp;lt;department&amp;gt;/&amp;lt;farm&amp;gt;/&amp;lt;node&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Topic Rule (B09 Telemetry Pattern Module):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  - SQL: &lt;code&gt;SELECT *, timestamp() AS received_at FROM 'aroma/telemetry/#'&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  - Appends metadata: cert principal, client ID, source IP, timestamps&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Two Direct Rule Actions:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  1. &lt;i&gt;DynamoDB Action:&lt;/i&gt; Conditional put directly to &lt;code&gt;telemetry&lt;/code&gt; table&lt;br/&gt;  2. &lt;i&gt;SQS Action:&lt;/i&gt; Enqueues reading reference to &lt;code&gt;threshold_queue&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Rule Error Action (Failure Path):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  - Failed deliveries routed to SQS Error Queue for redrive (ASM-161)&lt;br/&gt;  - Rejected connection/publish logged to &lt;code&gt;AWSIotLogsV2&lt;/code&gt; at ERROR" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#8da2b5;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#172b4d;fontSize=13.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;" parent="1" vertex="1">
  <mxGeometry x="700" y="175" width="490" height="465" as="geometry" />
</mxCell>
<mxCell id="badge_D09" value="D09" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dcebf7;strokeColor=#52708a;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#102a43;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1">
  <mxGeometry x="1125" y="185" width="52" height="26" as="geometry" />
</mxCell>
<mxCell id="b1_s3_card" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;4&quot; color=&quot;#102a43&quot;&gt;3. Primary Storage Target&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0b69a3&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Amazon DynamoDB Telemetry Store&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Target Table:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;code&gt;telemetry&lt;/code&gt; (DynamoDB on-demand mode)&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Primary Keys:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  - Partition Key: &lt;code&gt;node_id&lt;/code&gt; (String)&lt;br/&gt;  - Sort Key: &lt;code&gt;timestamp&lt;/code&gt; (Number, epoch milliseconds)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Encryption &amp;amp; Protection (D06):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  - Customer-managed KMS key (&lt;code&gt;telemetry&lt;/code&gt; key)&lt;br/&gt;  - Deletion protection: &lt;code&gt;prevent_destroy = true&lt;/code&gt; in Terraform&lt;br/&gt;  - Point-in-Time Recovery (PITR) enabled for continuous backups&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Retention &amp;amp; Compliance:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  - 5-year retention enforced automatically by TTL attribute&lt;br/&gt;  - Audited Event 3: Stores cert principal, source IP, receive time (ASM-067)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Scale:&lt;/b&gt; 3,600 readings/day peak; 3,600/min drain surge resilience" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#8da2b5;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#172b4d;fontSize=13.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;" parent="1" vertex="1">
  <mxGeometry x="1330" y="175" width="490" height="465" as="geometry" />
</mxCell>
<mxCell id="b1_s4_card" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;4&quot; color=&quot;#102a43&quot;&gt;4. Threshold Evaluation &amp;amp; Alerts&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0b69a3&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Event-Driven Processing (A14, A17)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Buffer Queue:&lt;/b&gt; SQS &lt;code&gt;threshold_queue&lt;/code&gt; (visibility timeout 300s)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Threshold Function (AWS Lambda, live alias):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  - Event Source Mapping with batch size 10 items&lt;br/&gt;  - Evaluates reading against versioned &lt;code&gt;thresholds&lt;/code&gt; DynamoDB table&lt;br/&gt;  - &lt;b&gt;Versioning Rule:&lt;/b&gt; Evaluated against threshold in force at&lt;br/&gt;    reading's &lt;i&gt;original timestamp&lt;/i&gt;, not receive time (ASM-138)&lt;br/&gt;  - Idempotent conditional write prevents duplicate evaluations&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Episode Coalescing &amp;amp; Case Opening:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  - Alerts open &lt;i&gt;once per episode&lt;/i&gt; (node, variable), NOT per reading&lt;br/&gt;  - Persists &lt;code&gt;crop_alert_raised&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;cases&lt;/code&gt; table; switches to precision mode&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Dual-Channel Farmer Notification Dispatch:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  - Publishes to KMS-encrypted SNS &lt;code&gt;alert_topic&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  - Lambda &lt;code&gt;notification_dispatcher&lt;/code&gt; sends App Push &amp;amp; SMS&lt;br/&gt;  - &lt;b&gt;Target:&lt;/b&gt; Delivered &amp;lt; 5 minutes for live reading (ASM-075)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#8da2b5;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#172b4d;fontSize=13.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;" parent="1" vertex="1">
  <mxGeometry x="1960" y="175" width="490" height="465" as="geometry" />
</mxCell>
<mxCell id="b1_s5_card" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;4&quot; color=&quot;#102a43&quot;&gt;5. Failure Paths &amp;amp; Rollback&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0b69a3&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Resilience &amp;amp; Correction (A18 sec 6, sec 10)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Dead-Letter Queue (DLQ) &amp;amp; Error Recovery:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  - &lt;code&gt;threshold_dlq&lt;/code&gt; captures failures after 5 attempts with backoff&lt;br/&gt;  - Unhandled IoT rule messages held in &lt;code&gt;aroma-telemetry-error-queue&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  - Operator redrives messages without redeployment after fix&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;CloudWatch Observability Hooks &amp;amp; Alarms:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  - &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;prefix&amp;gt;-pdn-alarm-threshold-errors&lt;/code&gt; &amp;amp; throttles on alias&lt;br/&gt;  - &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;prefix&amp;gt;-pdn-alarm-threshold-dlq-age&lt;/code&gt; &amp;gt; 0&lt;br/&gt;  - &lt;code&gt;ReadingNotPersisted&lt;/code&gt; metric &amp;amp; &lt;code&gt;AWSIotLogsV2&lt;/code&gt; error count&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;CodeDeploy Canary Rollback (&amp;lt; 10 min target):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  - Alarms during 10% canary automatically revert alias to previous version&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Forward Correction (What CANNOT be rolled back):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  - &lt;i&gt;Stored wrong attributes:&lt;/i&gt; Audited batch correction job&lt;br/&gt;  - &lt;i&gt;Sent alerts / SMS:&lt;/i&gt; Dispatched correction notice on same channels&lt;br/&gt;  - &lt;i&gt;Revoked certificates:&lt;/i&gt; Final action; re-enroll node with new CSR" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#8da2b5;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#172b4d;fontSize=13.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;" parent="1" vertex="1">
  <mxGeometry x="2590" y="175" width="490" height="465" as="geometry" />
</mxCell>
<mxCell id="band2_container" value="FLIGHT-OBJECT RECEPTION PIPELINE | left-to-right flow: ground station to S3, EventBridge, Bedrock inference &amp;amp; results (A15, A17, B10)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f8fc;strokeColor=#61788d;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#172b4d;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=15;" parent="1" vertex="1">
  <mxGeometry x="40" y="690" width="3120" height="540" as="geometry" />
</mxCell>
<mxCell id="b2_s1_card" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;4&quot; color=&quot;#102a43&quot;&gt;1. Ground Station Upload &amp;amp; Ingress&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0b69a3&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Contracted Drone Operator (ADR-002, A15, D04)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Actor &amp;amp; Location:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  - Contracted certified commercial drone operator (ADR-002)&lt;br/&gt;  - Collection center Soporte zone (IP &lt;code&gt;10.4x.2.10&lt;/code&gt;, VLAN 102)&lt;br/&gt;  - Or public link at municipal seat&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Upload Authorization (ASM-093):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  - 15-minute S3 pre-signed upload URLs generated by API role&lt;br/&gt;  - Pre-signed URLs bound strictly to flight prefix and SHA-256 checksums&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Network Ingress Endpoints (Collection Center, D04):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  - Ground station (10.4x.2.10) -&amp;gt; Center Firewall -&amp;gt; IPsec VPN tunnel -&amp;gt;&lt;br/&gt;    AWS Transit Gateway (D05) -&amp;gt; &lt;code&gt;object_storage&lt;/code&gt; S3 interface endpoint&lt;br/&gt;  - &lt;i&gt;Note: &lt;code&gt;drone_object_ingress&lt;/code&gt; tier is RESERVED (ASM-140); active path&lt;br/&gt;    uses &lt;code&gt;object_storage&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;application&lt;/code&gt; private interface endpoints&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Local Ground Station Buffer:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  - Operator encrypted storage holds photos and records while offline&lt;br/&gt;  - Deleted ONLY upon platform persistence receipt (A15 sec 7)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#8da2b5;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#172b4d;fontSize=13.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;" parent="1" vertex="1">
  <mxGeometry x="70" y="740" width="490" height="465" as="geometry" />
</mxCell>
<mxCell id="badge_D04" value="D04" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dcebf7;strokeColor=#52708a;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#102a43;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1">
  <mxGeometry x="495" y="750" width="52" height="26" as="geometry" />
</mxCell>
<mxCell id="b2_s2_card" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;4&quot; color=&quot;#102a43&quot;&gt;2. S3 Drone Object Bucket &amp;amp; Notifications&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0b69a3&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Object Ingestion &amp;amp; Audit Trail (A15, D06)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Target Bucket:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;code&gt;aroma-&amp;lt;env&amp;gt;-drone-objects&lt;/code&gt; (us-east-1)&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Security &amp;amp; Encryption Controls (CL-DRN-03, D06):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  - S3 Block Public Access enabled across all four dimensions&lt;br/&gt;  - S3 Object Versioning enabled (protects against overwrites/deletions)&lt;br/&gt;  - Customer-managed KMS key (&lt;code&gt;objects&lt;/code&gt; key)&lt;br/&gt;  - 5-year retention enforced by lifecycle rules&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Two-Phase Upload Sequence:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  1. &lt;i&gt;Flight objects uploaded:&lt;/i&gt; Orthomosaics, multispectral photos,&lt;br/&gt;     GPX flight tracks, telemetry logs&lt;br/&gt;  2. &lt;i&gt;Flight manifest uploaded:&lt;/i&gt; JSON manifest detailing all files, checksums,&lt;br/&gt;     mission ID, timestamps, sensor calibration data&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;S3 Event Notification Trigger:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  - &lt;code&gt;s3:ObjectCreated:*&lt;/code&gt; on manifest path invokes Lambda &lt;code&gt;reception&lt;/code&gt; function&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;CloudTrail S3 Data Events (Audited Event 4, ASM-067):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  - Logs &lt;code&gt;PutObject&lt;/code&gt; &amp;amp; &lt;code&gt;CompleteMultipartUpload&lt;/code&gt; to audit trail in Security Account" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#8da2b5;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#172b4d;fontSize=13.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;" parent="1" vertex="1">
  <mxGeometry x="700" y="740" width="490" height="465" as="geometry" />
</mxCell>
<mxCell id="b2_s3_card" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;4&quot; color=&quot;#102a43&quot;&gt;3. Reception Function &amp;amp; Screening&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0b69a3&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Validation, Privacy &amp;amp; Receipts (A15, A17)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;AWS Lambda Reception Function (live alias):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  - Invoked via S3 Event Notification upon manifest arrival&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Four Strict Validation Gates:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  1. &lt;b&gt;Manifest Verification:&lt;/b&gt; Validates SHA-256 hashes against active grant&lt;br/&gt;  2. &lt;b&gt;Quarantine Gate:&lt;/b&gt; Any object outside grant or with invalid checksum&lt;br/&gt;     moved immediately to &lt;code&gt;quarantine/&lt;/code&gt; prefix&lt;br/&gt;  3. &lt;b&gt;Privacy Screening (ASM-164, ASM-165):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;     - Images screened on ground station for human presence before upload&lt;br/&gt;     - Reception function moves flagged objects to &lt;code&gt;restricted/person/&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br/&gt;     - Encrypted under customer-managed &lt;code&gt;restricted&lt;/code&gt; KMS key&lt;br/&gt;     - &lt;i&gt;Only screened crop images can ever leave Colombia to Bedrock!&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  4. &lt;b&gt;Persistence Receipt:&lt;/b&gt; Emitted to ground station once all objects and&lt;br/&gt;     manifest are verified and linked (&lt;code&gt;record_persisted&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Mission Store Update:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  - Writes flight record, mission state (&lt;code&gt;record_persisted&lt;/code&gt;), and polygon&lt;br/&gt;    versions to DynamoDB &lt;code&gt;missions&lt;/code&gt; table (&lt;code&gt;records&lt;/code&gt; key, 5 years)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#8da2b5;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#172b4d;fontSize=13.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;" parent="1" vertex="1">
  <mxGeometry x="1330" y="740" width="490" height="465" as="geometry" />
</mxCell>
<mxCell id="b2_s4_card" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;4&quot; color=&quot;#102a43&quot;&gt;4. EventBridge Routing &amp;amp; Bedrock&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0b69a3&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Event-Driven Inference Pattern (A17, B10)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Event Decoupling Architecture:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  - DynamoDB Streams captures &lt;code&gt;record_persisted&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  - EventBridge Pipe routes events to custom &lt;code&gt;aroma-drone-bus&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Four Mission-Type Rules &amp;amp; SQS Queues:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  1. &lt;i&gt;Delimitation:&lt;/i&gt; Rule -&amp;gt; SQS -&amp;gt; Delimitation Lambda (activates polygon)&lt;br/&gt;  2. &lt;i&gt;Confirmation:&lt;/i&gt; Rule -&amp;gt; &lt;code&gt;infconfirmqueue&lt;/code&gt; (DLQ: &lt;code&gt;infconfirmdlq&lt;/code&gt;) -&amp;gt; Lambda&lt;br/&gt;  3. &lt;i&gt;Estimation:&lt;/i&gt; Rule -&amp;gt; &lt;code&gt;infestimatequeue&lt;/code&gt; (DLQ: &lt;code&gt;infestimatedlq&lt;/code&gt;) -&amp;gt; Lambda&lt;br/&gt;  4. &lt;i&gt;Verification:&lt;/i&gt; Rule -&amp;gt; &lt;code&gt;infverificationqueue&lt;/code&gt; (DLQ: &lt;code&gt;infverificationdlq&lt;/code&gt;) -&amp;gt; Lambda&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Amazon Bedrock Inference (us-east-1):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  - Calls vision foundation model (Amazon Nova Pro) by model ID&lt;br/&gt;  - Packages embed zero-shot prompt &amp;amp; schema (&lt;code&gt;prompt_version&lt;/code&gt;, ASM-179)&lt;br/&gt;  - Persists result: timestamp, confidence, &lt;code&gt;function_version&lt;/code&gt;, source object&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Strict Human Governance (ADR-002, Part E):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  - Agronomist with MFA session &amp;lt;= 10 min authorizes fumigation orders&lt;br/&gt;  - &lt;i&gt;Bedrock model NEVER authorizes fumigation or closes cases&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#8da2b5;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#172b4d;fontSize=13.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;" parent="1" vertex="1">
  <mxGeometry x="1960" y="740" width="490" height="465" as="geometry" />
</mxCell>
<mxCell id="badge_D10" value="D10" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dcebf7;strokeColor=#52708a;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#102a43;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1">
  <mxGeometry x="2385" y="750" width="52" height="26" as="geometry" />
</mxCell>
<mxCell id="b2_s5_card" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;4&quot; color=&quot;#102a43&quot;&gt;5. Failure Paths &amp;amp; Recovery&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0b69a3&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Resilience &amp;amp; Rollback (A18 sec 7, sec 10)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Per-Function Dead-Letter Queues (DLQ):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  - &lt;code&gt;infconfirmdlq&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;infverificationdlq&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;infestimatedlq&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  - 5 retries with backoff; operator redrives without redeployment&lt;br/&gt;  - Idempotent execution: retrying an invocation causes zero duplicates&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;CloudWatch Observability Hooks &amp;amp; Alarms:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  - &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;prefix&amp;gt;-pdn-alarm-&amp;lt;fn&amp;gt;-errors&lt;/code&gt; &amp;amp; throttles on alias&lt;br/&gt;  - &lt;code&gt;InferenceFailed&lt;/code&gt; custom metric &amp;amp; &lt;code&gt;MissionsAwaitingResult&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  - DLQ message age alarms trigger operational alerting&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;CodeDeploy Canary Rollback (&amp;lt; 10 min target):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  - Canary alarm automatically reverts alias to previous version&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Infrastructure Rollback (&amp;lt; 2 hr target):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  - Revert commit via promotion for EventBridge rules, S3 policies, routing&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Forward Correction (What CANNOT be rolled back):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  - &lt;i&gt;Uploaded objects:&lt;/i&gt; Never deleted on rollback; buffer preserved&lt;br/&gt;  - &lt;i&gt;Inference results:&lt;/i&gt; Superseded by newer results (&lt;code&gt;function_version&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;br/&gt;  - &lt;i&gt;Activated polygons:&lt;/i&gt; Replaced by activating previous polygon&lt;br/&gt;  - &lt;i&gt;Quarantined objects:&lt;/i&gt; Restored from versioned S3 with INC reference" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#8da2b5;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#172b4d;fontSize=13.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;" parent="1" vertex="1">
  <mxGeometry x="2590" y="740" width="490" height="465" as="geometry" />
</mxCell>
